                // This is coefficient of x^m in m! * prod_{v in U} (sum_{c != v} x^c / c!).
                // prod_{v in U} (e^x - x^v/v!) = e^{|U|x} * prod (1 - x^v/(v! e^x))...
                // Since n <= 28, we can do DP over values.
